      "line": 1,
      "zh": "冰壶残局：十二局定线",
      "en": "Curling Endgame: Twelve-End Lines"
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 3,
      "zh": "每局三次投壶：选择出手角度与力度，利用碰撞、占位和按钮区计分。这里是抽象物理益智模型，不用于真实冰壶训练或比赛安全决策。",
      "en": "Three throws per end: choose release angle and power, and score using collisions, positioning and the button zone. This is an abstract physics puzzle model and is not for real curling training or match safety decisions."
    },
