      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 3,
      "zh": "物理",
      "en": "Physics"
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 3,
      "zh": "冰壶从左侧出发，力度决定前进距离，角度决定横向落点；接近已有冰壶会发生可解释的碰撞位移。",
      "en": "Stones start from the left; power sets the distance and angle sets the sideways landing point. Getting close to existing stones causes explainable collision displacement."
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 3,
      "zh": "三星",
      "en": "Three stars"
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 3,
      "zh": "三次投壶后得分达到本局目标，并使用不超过正式参考的总力度；提示示范最高两星。模型仅用于抽象益智玩法，不代表真实冰面或比赛策略。",
      "en": "Reach the end target score after three throws using no more than the official reference total power; hinted demos give at most two stars. The model is only for abstract puzzle play and does not represent real ice or match strategy."
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 3,
      "zh": "十二局定线残局",
      "en": "Twelve-End Line Puzzles"
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 3,
      "zh": "四章逐步加入守卫石、双碰撞和高分按钮区。正式枚举器遍历 25 种角度/力度组合的三次序列，用同一碰撞与计分函数找出最低总力度的目标得分路线。",
      "en": "Four chapters add guard stones, double collisions and high-scoring button zones. The official enumerator walks three-throw sequences across 25 angle/power combinations, using the same collision and scoring function to find the lowest-total-power route to the target score."
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 3,
      "zh": "返回冰壶台",
      "en": "Back to curling table"
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "北岸护卫",
      "en": "North Shore Guard"
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "清掉按钮区前的守卫石，再留下两枚得分石。",
      "en": "Clear the guard stone in front of the button, then leave two scoring stones."
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "双线切入",
      "en": "Double-Line Cut-In"
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "两枚对手石分居按钮两侧，需要一轻一重的线路。",
      "en": "Two opponent stones sit on either side of the button; you need one light and one heavy line."
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "角落占位",
      "en": "Corner Placement"
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "角落石不计分，第三投要把自己的石送入中心圈。",
      "en": "Corner stones do not score; the third throw must send your stone into the center ring."
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "中线碰撞",
      "en": "Center-Line Collision"
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "中线守卫会挡住直线，碰撞后才能进入按钮区。",
      "en": "A center-line guard blocks the straight line; you must collide before entering the button zone."
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "蓝冰反弧",
      "en": "Blue Ice Counter-Curve"
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "右旋偏移放大，角度比力度更重要。",
      "en": "Right-hand curl is amplified; angle matters more than power."
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "双守卫",
      "en": "Double Guards"
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "两个守卫石压住按钮，第三投需要保留足够力度。",
      "en": "Two guard stones press down on the button; the third throw needs enough power in reserve."
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "后手保护",
      "en": "Last-Rock Protection"
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "先手石要留在中心，后两投负责把对手推出圈。",
      "en": "Keep the first stone at the center; the last two throws must push the opponent out of the ring."
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "窄口入营",
      "en": "Narrow-Entry Camp"
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "目标窗口很窄，三次投壶的总力度受到限制。",
      "en": "The target window is narrow, and total power across three throws is limited."
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "撞击换位",
      "en": "Hit and Swap"
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "对手石靠近中心，直接得分与撞击得分都可行。",
      "en": "An opponent stone sits near the center; scoring directly and scoring by impact both work."
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "远端回旋",
      "en": "Far-End Loop"
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "第一投需要为后续碰撞留下线路。",
      "en": "The first throw must leave a line open for later collisions."
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "三石封锁",
      "en": "Three-Stone Blockade"
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "按钮边缘被三颗石头包围，稳定进分更优于冒险清台。",
      "en": "The button edge is surrounded by three stones; steady scoring beats a risky clear."
    },
    {
      "file": "curling-endgame.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 4,
      "zh": "终局：最后一线",
      "en": "Finale: Last Line"
    },
